span>Admission Guide</span></a><a href="../ko/quick.php?xbrd=23"><span>Application Form</span></a></div></div> <div class="lndi lndi_desc"><div class="contDiv"><p align=right><span><a href="javascript:" onkeypress="font_scale(1);" onmousedown="font_scale(1);" title="확대"><img src="../webmanager/template/location_top/lnb_top_white/image/ico_plus.png" alt="확대"/></a></span><span><a href="javascript:" onkeypress="font_scale(-1);" onmousedown="font_scale(-1);" title="축소"><img src="../webmanager/template/location_top/lnb_top_white/image/ico_minus.png" alt="축소"/></a></span><span><a href="javascript:" onclick="print_body('print_lay', 'kr'); return false;" title="인쇄하기"><img src="../webmanager/template/location_top/lnb_top_white/image/ico_print.png" alt="인쇄하기"/></a></span></p></div></div></div></div><!-- //lnb --><div class="clear"></div> </div><div class="container_inner"> <!-- wrap_content --><div id="wrap_content"><div class="wrap_content_inner" data-role="page-container" data-page-type="normal" data-page-status="ready"><!-- location --><div class="wrap_content_location"> <div id="menu_location"><div><ul><li><a href="../ko/quick.php?xbrd=18" title="Academic Schedule" class="w_100 btn2 btn_gray"><span>Academic Schedule</span></a></li><li><a href="../ko/quick.php?xbrd=11" title="Academic Regulations" class="w_100 btn2 btn_gray"><span>Academic Regulations</span></a></li><li><a href="../ko/quick.php?xbrd=10" title="Admission Guide" class="w_100 btn2 btn_blue"><span>Admission Guide</span></a></li><li><a href="../ko/quick.php?xbrd=23" title="Application Form" class="w_100 btn2 btn_gray"><span>Application Form</span></a></li></ul></div></div><div class="clear"></div> </div><!-- //location --> <div id="print_lay" class="print_lay"> <div id="print_lay_body_1"><div class="ul_reset" ><div id="view_box2"><h2><span style="font-size: 14px;"><b>Application Guideline</b></span></h2> <p>Korean&nbsp;<a href="javascript:;" id="attack_10_222" onclick="fdown('ko','10','222');"><img alt="download" border="0" src="/webmanager/build/image/file/small/pdf.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;" />&nbsp;Korean Language Institute(SGU)_KOR.pdf</a></p> <p>English&nbsp;<a href="javascript:;" id="attack_10_224" onclick="fdown('ko','10','224');"><img alt="download" border="0" src="/webmanager/build/image/file/small/pdf.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;" />&nbsp;Korean Language Institute(SGU)_ENG.pdf</a></p> <p>Vietnamese&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="javascript:;" id="attack_10_226" onclick="fdown('ko','10','226');"><img alt="download" border="0" src="/webmanager/build/image/file/small/pdf.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;" />&nbsp;Korean Language Institute(SGU)_VNM.pdf</a></p> <p>Chinese&nbsp;<a href="javascript:;" id="attack_10_223" onclick="fdown('ko','10','223');"><img alt="download" border="0" src="/webmanager/build/image/file/small/pdf.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;" />&nbsp;Korean Language Institute(SGU)_CHA.pdf</a></p> <p>Uzbek&nbsp;<a href="javascript:;" id="attack_10_225" onclick="fdown('ko','10','225');"><img alt="download" border="0" src="/webmanager/build/image/file/small/pdf.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;" />&nbsp;Korean Language Institute(SGU)_Uzbek2024.pdf</a></p> <h2><strong style="font-size: 14px;">Course Introduction</strong><span style="font-size: 14px;">&nbsp;</span></h2> <p>As a systematic and intensive Korean language course for foreigners who want to study abroad and practice their Korean, the regular term program provides integrated education of communication oriented speaking, listening, reading and writing. The program aims for not only improving communicative competence based on real life, but also improving Korean language skills needed for entering school.&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style="font-size:14px;">Course Schedule</span></strong></p> <table border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" class="table_bar table_nowrap table_css_click" width="100%"><colgroup><col width="20%" /><col width="20%" /><col width="20%" /><col width="20%" /><col width="20%" /></colgroup><thead><tr align="center"><td>Year</td><td>Spring</td><td>Summer</td><td>Fall</td><td>Winter</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>2025</th><td style="text-align: center;">2025.03.04.~2025.05.14.</td><td style="text-align: center;">2025.06.02~2025.08.11.</td><td style="text-align: center;">2025.09.01.~2025.11.17.</td><td style="text-align: center;">2025.12.01.~2026.02.18.</td></tr><tr><th><p>Application Deadline</p></th><td style="text-align: center;">2025.01.24.</td><td style="text-align: center;">2025.04.25</td><td style="text-align: center;">2025.07.25</td><td style="text-align: center;">2025.10.24.</td></tr><tr><th>Orientation</th><td style="text-align: center;">2025.02.26.</td><td style="text-align: center;">2025.05.28.</td><td style="text-align: center;">2025.08.27.</td><td style="text-align: center;">2025.11.26.</td></tr></tbody></table> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ※ Boxing Day(holiday): 2025.12.26.</p> <p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ※ Lunar New Year(holiday): 2026.01.27.~2026.02.02.</p> <div style="background: rgb(247,247,247); padding-bottom: 20px; padding-top: 20px; padding-left: 20px; margin-top: 20px; padding-right: 20px"><ul><li>The academic year is consisted of 4 semesters(Spring, Summer, Fall, Winter) and divided into 6 levels.</li><li>Non-Korean learners are placed in beginner classes and do not take the level test.&nbsp;</li><li>Provide opportunity to continue studying at Singyeongju University.</li><li>Provide Korean cultural classes that are linked to the Korean language curriculum to help students gain more various experience in Korea.&nbsp;</li><li>The schedules are subject to change according to the academic calendar.&nbsp;</li></ul></div> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style="font-size: 14px;">Application Process</span></strong></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>1) Submit documents</p> <p>2) Document examination</p> <p>3) Receive notice of success in admission and tuition fee invoice</p> <p>4) Tuition fee payment</p> <p>5) Receive admission letter</p> <p>6) Apply for visa</p> <p>7) Receive visa</p> <p>8) Start of semester @SGU</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>- The time required from submitting admission documents to obtaining a visa varies by the country of residence, so you must check the visa information at the diplimatic missions of South Korea in advance.&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style="font-size: 14px;">How to apply</span></strong></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>- All documents mst be submitted to the Admission Office either by post or in person.&nbsp;</p> <p>Please, inquire through phone or email.</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>Phone number : +82-54-770-5075, 5310(Mon-Fri, 9am-5:30pm KST)</p> <p>Fax number : +82-54-746-5210</p> <p>Email : <span style="color:#FF0000;"><span style="font-size:12px;"><u><strong>singyeongju@daum.net</strong></u></span></span></p> <p>Mail-in : <span style="color:#0000FF;"><span style="font-size:12px;"><strong>Korean Language Institute at Singyeongju University(postal code : 38065)</strong></span></span></p> <p><span style="color:#0000FF;"><span style="font-size:12px;"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 188, Taejong-ro, Gyeongju-si, Gyeongsangbuk-do, Republic of Korea</strong></span></span></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong><span style="font-size: 14px;">Documents Required</span></strong></p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>- Application documents may vary depending on the applicant&#39;s nationality.</p> <p>- All documents must be translated into Korean.</p> <p>- Admission may be cancelled if forged or false documents are submitted.</p> <p>- During the process of document examination, additional document might be requested, and documents that are once submitted cannot be returned.&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>***&nbsp; Download &quot;<u>Application Forms</u>&quot; from the website.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>[Academic documents for Chinese students]</p> <p>High school graduates : www.chsi.com.cn</p> <p>University graduates : www.cdgdc.edu.cn</p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <h2><strong><span style="font-size: 14px;">Tuition &amp; Fees</span></strong></h2> <table border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" class="table_bar table_nowrap" summary="등록금 및 제비용" width="100%"><colgroup><col width="30%" /><col width="30%" /><col /></colgroup><thead><tr align="center"><td>Types</td><td>Amount</td><td>Note</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Application fee</th><td style="text-align: center;">KRW 100,000</td><td style="text-align: center;">non-refundable</td></tr><tr align="center"><th>Tuition fee</th><td>KRW 1,200,000</td><td>1 semester(based on year 2023)</td></tr><tr align="center"><th>Insurance fee</th><td>KRW 100,000</td><td>6 month</td></tr><tr><th>Dormitory fee</th><td style="text-align: center;">KRW 1,050,000</td><td style="text-align: center;">6 month</td></tr></tbody></table> <h2><strong><span style="font-size: 14px;">Tuition Payment Information</span></strong></h2> <table border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" class="table_bar table_nowrap" summary="교재 비용" width="100%"><colgroup><col width="30%" /><col width="30%" /><col /></colgroup><thead><tr align="center"><td><strong style="text-align: -webkit-center;">Bank Name</strong></td><td>DGB DAEGU BANK</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr align="center"><th style="text-align: center;">Account No.&nbsp;</th><td>504-10-159762-2</td></tr><tr><th>Depositor</th><td style="text-align: center;">SinGyeongju University</td></tr><tr><th>SWIFT CODE</th><td style="text-align: center;"><p>DAEBKR22</p></td></tr><tr><th>Address</th><th>67 Hwarang ro, Gyeong Ju, Gyeong Buk, Korea</th></tr></tbody></table>&nbsp; <p>&nbsp;</p> <h2><span style="font-size: 14px;"><b>Refund Policy</b></span></h2> <div style="background: rgb(247,247,247); padding-bottom: 20px; padding-top: 20px; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px">- The admission fee is used as the expense of visa procedure, foreign mail, etc.., and is un-refundable.&nbsp;</div> <div style="background: rgb(247,247,247); padding-bottom: 20px; padding-top: 20px; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px">- In case a visa is refused or the student withdraw one&#39;s registration before the start of school, a full refund of tuition is available.</div> <div style="background: rgb(247,247,247); padding-bottom: 20px; padding-top: 20px; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px">&nbsp;<table border="0" cellpadding="10" cellspacing="0" class="table_bar table_nowrap" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);" summary="교재 비용" width="100%"><colgroup><col width="30%" /><col width="30%" /><col /></colgroup><thead><tr align="center"><td>Period of refund</td><td>Refund amount</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr align="center"><th style="text-align: left;">Before the semester starts</th><td style="text-align: left;">Full Refund</td></tr><tr><th style="text-align: left;"><p>Cancellation before one third(1/3) of the total hours of the</p> <p>month that the student has required for the refund</p></th><td>A two-thirds(2/3) refund on tuition fee</td></tr><tr><th style="text-align: left;"><p><span style="font-weight: 700; text-align: center;">Cancellation before half(1/2) of the total hours of the month that</span></p> <p><span style="font-weight: 700; text-align: center;">the student has required for the refund</span></p></th><td style="text-align: center;"><p style="text-align: left;">A half(1/2) refund on tuition fee</p></td></tr><tr><th style="text-align: left;"><p><span style="font-weight: 700; text-align: center;">Cancellation after half(1/2) of the total hours of the month that</span></p> <p><span style="font-weight: 700; text-align: center;">the student has required for the refund</span></p></th><th style="text-align: left;">No Refund</th></tr></tbody></table> <p>&nbsp;</p></div> <div style="background: rgb(247,247,247); padding-bottom: 20px; padding-top: 20px; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px">&nbsp;</div> <div style="background: rgb(247,247,247); padding-bottom: 20px; padding-top: 20px; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px">&nbsp;</div> <div style="background: rgb(247,247,247); padding-bottom: 20px; padding-top: 20px; padding-left: 20px; padding-right: 20px"><h2 style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</h2></div></div> <p style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: -0.5px; word-break: break-word; font-family: &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Dotum, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, MalgunGothic, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</p></div></div><br> </div> <!-- //print_lay --></div> <!-- // wrap_content_inner --></div> <!-- // #wrap_content --><!-- banner --><!--// banner--></div><!-- // container_inner --></div><!-- //container --> <div class="clearfix clear"></div><div id="wrap_copyright"><!-- copyright --><div class="wrap_gap_width"> <div class="clear wrap_foot foot_contents"><div><div style="padding:15px 0;text-align:center">(38065) 경북 경주시 태종로 188 경주대학교 한국어학당 / Tel: 054-770-5310 / Fax: 054-746-5210<br />Copyright ⓒ 2016 경주대학교 All rights reserved.</div></div> </div><!-- //wrap_foot --></div><!-- //copyright --> </div></div> <!-- //wrap_inner --></div> <!-- //wrap --><!-- banner --> <div id="quick_banner" class="quick_banner"><center></center></div> <!--// banner--> <div id="UserIdLayer" style="display:none;position:absolute;left:0;top:0;z-index:1"></div><div style="display:none"><iframe name='iframe_blank' id='iframe_blank' src="about:blank" width=0 height=0 scrolling=no frameborder=0 style="width:0px;height:0px;margin:0px;margin:0px;border:0px;display:none;" title="blank">blank frame</iframe></div> <div id="layerBg"></div><!-- //layer Popup --> 
